### =====================================================================
### 10.4 FLOW 3 — CLIENT: Self-registers on al-salamah -> verifies OTP -> logs in
### =====================================================================

### 10.4.1 Client Self-Registers on the Al-Salamah Branded Portal - Expect 200 OK
# @name registerClient
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register-client
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar
X-Tenant-Domain: al-salamah

{
  "fullName": "Fahad Al-Dossari",
  "email": "fahad.client@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+966501234599",
  "password": "ClientSecure@123"
}

@clientUserId = {{registerClient.data.userId}}
@clientOtp = {{registerClient.data.devOnlyOtp}}

### 10.4.2 Client Verifies OTP & Activates Account - Expect 200 OK with JWT
# @name verifyClientOtp
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/verify-client-otp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "userId": "{{clientUserId}}",
  "otp": "{{clientOtp}}"
}

@clientToken = {{verifyClientOtp.data.accessToken}}

### 10.4.3 New Client Logs In With Their Chosen Password - Expect 200 OK
# @name clientLogin
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar
X-Tenant-Domain: al-salamah

{
  "email": "fahad.client@example.com",
  "password": "ClientSecure@123"
}

### 10.4.4 Client Self-Registration Without Tenant Context (No Header/Subdomain) - Expect 400 Bad Request
# @name registerClientNoTenant
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register-client
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "fullName": "No Tenant Client",
  "email": "notenant.client@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+966501234598",
  "password": "ClientSecure@123"
}

### =====================================================================
### 10.5 NEGATIVE & BOUNDARY TESTS
### =====================================================================

### 10.5.1 DeputyAdmin Attempts to Invite Tenant Staff - Expect 403 Forbidden [SOVEREIGN BOUNDARY]
# @name deputyAdminInviteBlocked
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenant-users
Authorization: Bearer {{deputyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "fullName": "Blocked Invite Attempt",
  "email": "blocked.invite@al-salamah.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+966501234566",
  "role": 202,
  "preferredLanguage": "ar"
}

### 10.5.2 CompanyAdmin Attempts to Invite a Client via Staff Endpoint - Expect 400 Bad Request
### Clients must self-register via the branded portal, not be invited as staff.
# @name inviteClientBlocked
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenant-users
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "fullName": "Should Be Blocked",
  "email": "shouldbeblocked@al-salamah.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+966501234567",
  "role": 207,
  "preferredLanguage": "ar"
}

### 10.5.3 Non-SuperAdmin Attempts to Invite Platform Staff - Expect 403 Forbidden
# @name companyAdminInvitePlatformBlocked
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/platform/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "fullName": "Should Be Blocked",
  "email": "shouldbeblocked@amanix.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+966501234568",
  "role": 101,
  "preferredLanguage": "ar"
}

### 10.5.4 Unauthenticated Access to Platform Staff Invitation - Expect 401 Unauthorized
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/platform/staff
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "fullName": "Should Be Blocked",
  "email": "noauth@amanix.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+966501234569",
  "role": 101,
  "preferredLanguage": "ar"
}

### 10.5.5 Invalid/Tampered Invitation Token - Expect 400 Bad Request
# @name acceptInvalidToken
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/accept-tenant-invitation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "userId": "{{engineerUserId}}",
  "invitationToken": "dGhpcyBpcyBhIHRhbXBlcmVkIHRva2Vu",
  "newPassword": "SomeSecure@123",
  "confirmPassword": "SomeSecure@123"
}

### 10.5.6 Accept an Already-Accepted Invitation Again (replay) - Expect 400 Bad Request
# @name acceptInvitationReplay
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/accept-tenant-invitation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "userId": "{{engineerUserId}}",
  "invitationToken": "{{engineerInvitationToken}}",
  "newPassword": "AnotherSecure@123",
  "confirmPassword": "AnotherSecure@123"
}

### 10.5.7 Accept a Tenant Invitation Through the Platform Endpoint (wrong plane) - Expect 400 Bad Request
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/accept-platform-invitation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "userId": "{{newDeputyUserId}}",
  "invitationToken": "{{newDeputyInvitationToken}}",
  "newPassword": "WrongPlane@123",
  "confirmPassword": "WrongPlane@123"
}

### 10.5.8 Accept Invitation With Mismatched Password Confirmation - Expect 400 Bad Request
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/accept-tenant-invitation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "userId": "{{maintenanceWorkerUserId}}",
  "invitationToken": "{{maintenanceWorkerInvitationToken}}",
  "newPassword": "PasswordOne@123",
  "confirmPassword": "PasswordTwo@123"
}

### 10.5.9 Client Verifies OTP With Wrong Code (3x, then locked out) - Expect 400 Bad Request each time
# @name verifyClientOtpWrong1
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/verify-client-otp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "userId": "{{clientUserId}}",
  "otp": "000001"
}

### 10.5.10 Invite Staff With an Already-Registered Email - Expect 400 Bad Request
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenant-users
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "fullName": "Duplicate Email Attempt",
  "email": "{{companyAdminEmail}}",
  "phoneNumber": "+966501234570",
  "role": 202,
  "preferredLanguage": "ar"
}

### 10.5.11 Invite Platform Staff With an Invalid Role (e.g. SystemSuperAdmin) - Expect 400 Bad Request
